      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-16T08:01:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I was attempting the \"Mobbed by Paparazzi\" challenge, where you need to win a fight without using powers, and I was impressed by how well the flavor lines of up regarding which heros mind the paparazzi the most.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My team was Legacy, Fanatic, Ra, Tempest, and Tachyon. &nbsp;With the possible exception of Tempest, these are among the most showy characters, the ones I'd expect to be most comfortable dealing with paparazzi. &nbsp;Meanwhile, the four most power-dependent heros are Wraith, Mr. Fixer, Unity, and Argent Adept. &nbsp;With the exception of Unity, these are among the most private and reclusive of the heros.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:40.165Z",
