      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-20T15:31:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow - does anyone actually HAVE that?&nbsp; Even facing Ambuscade in an easy environment, I can't think of a ton you could do.&nbsp; I guess Newest Legacy, (Mostly Adamant) Sentinels, Dark Visionary, Omnitron-X, and The Naturalist <em>might</em> be able to do things?</p><p>(Unless Santa-Guise and Kvothe are still legal, but I assume the video game doesn't have them?)</p><p>Well, I did ask for difficult alternate modes.&nbsp; Here goes nothing.</p>",
