      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabk/{size}/1978_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-20T16:21:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The achievement dictates that no hero cards enter play at all, so Santa Guise, SST, Kvothe, and O-X are out as well.<br><br>I got it shortly after it came out by bringing heavy hitters (DWFixer, Young Legs, Haka) and a rapidly incapped Tempest against Iron Legacy. Others have had good success using O-X and SST to dump Gloomweaver relics in the trash.</p>",
