      "raw": "<p>The achievement dictates that no hero cards enter play at all, so Santa Guise, SST, Kvothe, and O-X are out as well.<br /><br />I got it shortly after it came out by bringing heavy hitters (DWFixer, Young Legs, Haka) and a rapidly incapped Tempest against Iron Legacy. Others have had good success using O-X and SST to dump Gloomweaver relics in the trash.</p>",
