      "id": 162458,
      "name": "riff.freelance",
      "username": "riff.freelance",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/riff.freelance/{size}/2050_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-20T18:43:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I did it 2 ways: SST, Grandpa Legacy, Dark Visionary, O-X and DW Fixer in Wasteland to get Gloomweaver's relics in the trash (Failed miserably as the wasteland removed a relic, barely squeezed out a win by DW Fixer geting all Leg's love.) And Legacy, Ra, DW Fixer, Tempest, and F6 Wraith vs Ambuscade in Wasteland in a damage race.</p><p>It is indeed called \"Extreme Hostage Situation\" and many people say Mad Bomber Blade with a team of bruisers is the way to go.</p><p>Shameless bragging here: I just got my last achievment unlocked today. I have them all until next upade.</p><p>Aside: the game has Base, Infernal Relics, Rook City, Shattered Timelines, Scholar and Unity (Ambuscade, Miss Info, Wasteland and Gulch to complete mini expansions) released so far. So that's the roster available. As to the achievment list (and a bit more bragging)&nbsp;http://steamcommunity.com/id/riff4freelance/stats/appid/337150/achievements shows them and the unlocks (which can be a fun challenge ) are showe on the Handleabra website here:&nbsp;http://sentinelsdigital.com/variants.html</p><p>Happy \"saving the multiverse!\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
